    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1328">

                <pb facs="0896" n="780" xml:id="pg780"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.115/100.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Brazilian Minister
                        at Mexico City.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-10-19">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 19, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>American Vice Consul in charge Guadalajara reports that in default payment
                    special tax ten thousand pesos authorities threaten attachment property Compañía
                    Galletera Nacional, stock of which is almost entirely American owned.</p>
                <p>Please request appropriate authorities to order withdrawal of demand for payment
                    this tax which appears to be an extraordinary special tax not general and
                    uniform in operation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
